00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.970
Now, I assure you that Mr. Grossmith feels...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.020
deeply, very deeply, the tragedy of this affair. And his point is, naturally, not to throw

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:11.650
consternation into that great and unseen army of Mr. Brent's admirers. Now that is precisely

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:16.470
what Mr. Grossmith means. That's just what I was going to say. Mr. Turner. Mr. Turner.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:20.940
Pardon me. What is it? The papers are on my neck. I've got to tell them something. There's

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.700
no use telling any longer. They've got a story now about a mysterious woman. They don't know

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.460
themselves, but they say it makes a great story. Tell him it was an accident. They won't believe

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.960
it. Then make them. You don't know.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.960
those boys. They've got imagination. I don't care if they've got fallen arches. Tell them the

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:40.610
branch shooting was an unfortunate accident. Yes. That satisfactory to you, Lieutenant? Nothing

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:46.580
