00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.380
Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to meddle. I just wanted to help.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.660
You see, I like to dabble a bit in murder cases.

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.000
Well, you just go and dabble someplace else.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.320
All right.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:17.960
