00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.810
One of our scenario writers, Franklin Drew.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.390
Oh, writes detective stories, I suppose.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.100
Yes.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.350
