00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.370
They always do.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.740
Well, this makes a difference.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:32.250
Looks like we've got a murder on our hands.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.000
Oh, you go and get that assistant director.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.820
That brilliant young man who said there were no other guns on this set.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:38.280
